  "gameDescriptionHtml": "\nTales Beyond The Tomb is an episodic horror series that immerses players in the shadows of real-life cases.<p></p>\n<p>Inspired by the atmospheric horror of the ’80s and ’90s, each episode recreates terrifying experiences lived by real people, blending nostalgia with relentless suspense.</p>\n<p>This is the third episode in the series. Episode 3: The Last Vigil – Nick Harrison, the new night guard at Guadalupe Cemetery, believes he’s taking on a quiet night shift. However, as darkness falls, he quickly realizes he’s gravely mistaken. The cemetery holds more than just the dead. A first-person exploration experience where realism is key. Navigate mysterious locations, face your darkest fears, and uncover disturbing truths hidden in the shadows of real-life cases.</p>\n<p><b>Game Features</b></p>\n<ul>\n<li><b>VHS Aesthetic</b>: A throwback to the classic horror films of the ’80s and ’90s with nostalgic visuals.\n</li><li><b>Photorealistic Graphics and Immersive Environments</b>: Detailed scenes that heighten tension and immersion.\n</li><li><b>Player Voice Interaction</b>: Microphone-enabled gameplay for an even scarier experience (microphone optional).\n</li><li><b>Text-Based Dialogue System</b>: Dynamic narratives delivered through engaging dialogues.\n</li><li><b>Realistic Driving</b>: Fully physics-based car driving system.\n</li></ul>\n",
